{"speciesId":156,"names":{"fr":"Feurisson","es":"Quilava","en":"Quilava","ja":"マグマラシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"This POKéMON is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Before battle, it turns its back on its opponent to demonstrate how ferociously its fire blazes."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"QUILAVA keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This POKéMON applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"QUILAVA keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This POKéMON applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It intimidates foes with intense gusts of flames and superheated air. Its quick nimbleness lets it dodge attacks even while scorching an enemy."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This POKéMON is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"This Pokémon is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La chaleur de ses flammes intimide l’ennemi. Elles s’intensifient lorsqu’il se prépare à combattre."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La chaleur de ses flammes intimide l’ennemi. Elles s’intensifient lorsqu’il se prépare à combattre."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Avant chaque combat, il tourne le dos et montre la puissance de ses flammes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Antes de empezar a luchar, se gira ante su rival para alardear del alcance y la fuerza de sus llamas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Before battle, it turns its back on its opponent to demonstrate how ferociously its fire blazes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"戦いの前 背中を 向けて 自分の 炎が どれくらい すごいかを 相手に 見せつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Attention ! Quand il tourne le dos dans un combat, c’est qu’il va attaquer avec ses flammes dorsales."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ten cuidado si te da la espalda en combate. Significa que te va a atacar con su lomo de fuego."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"戦闘中 背中を 向けたら 要注意。 背中の 炎で 攻撃してくる 前触れだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feurisson garde ses ennemis à distance grâce à l’intensité de ses flammes et à des rafales d’air brûlant. Ce Pokémon utilise son incroyable agilité pour éviter les attaques, tout en enflammant ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quilava mantiene a sus rivales a raya con la intensidad de sus llamas y las ráfagas de aire ígneo que producen. También aprovecha su espectacular agilidad para esquivar ataques a la vez que abrasa al rival con sus llamas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quilava keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This Pokémon applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"炎の 勢いと 熱風で 威嚇する。 素早い 身のこなしで 相手の 攻撃を かわしながら 同時に 炎で 燃やす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Feurisson garde ses ennemis à distance grâce à l’intensité de ses flammes et à des rafales d’air brûlant. Ce Pokémon utilise son incroyable agilité pour éviter les attaques, tout en enflammant ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quilava mantiene a sus rivales a raya con la intensidad de sus llamas y las ráfagas de aire ígneo que producen. También aprovecha su espectacular agilidad para esquivar ataques a la vez que abrasa al rival con sus llamas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quilava keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This Pokémon applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"炎の 勢いと 熱風で 威嚇する。 素早い 身のこなしで 相手の 攻撃を かわしながら 同時に 炎で 燃やす。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"This creature's fur is most mysterio